dow, not fitting in with her surroundings. However, when he could no longer control his own perverted sexuality, the \"teacher\" was driven by remorse and resigned from his position. He becomes an obedient dog to Yumeko, who plays with his twisted sexuality, and vows to obey her.\n\n(Source: Mediabank, translated)"},"tags":[{"name":"Dissociative Identities","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Cunnilingus","rank":60,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Watersports","rank":20,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Ashikoki","rank":20,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Virginity","rank":20,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Rimjob","rank":20,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Nakadashi","rank":20,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Handjob","rank":20,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Feet","rank":20,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Fellatio","rank":20,"spoiler":false}],"titles":{"display":"NocturnaL","english":null,"native":"NocturnaL","romaji":"NocturnaL","synonyms":[]},"trailer":null,"visibility":"adult"}